# With no build step, Vercel serves the repository root as static files — so
# anything tracked here is fetchable on the live domain unless it is excluded.
#
# apps-script/Code.gs matters most: it has a SECRET constant and a Zoho
# clientSecret/refreshToken block. Those are meant to be filled in inside the
# Apps Script editor rather than committed, but if they ever are, this keeps
# them off the public site.
apps-script/
docs/
README.md

# Do NOT add package.json, package-lock.json, or tsconfig.json here — the
# api/chat.ts function build needs them to install and compile.
